@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### 1) 주문용 상품 A 생성
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "orderProduct-A",
  "description": "for order test A",
  "categoryId": 10,
  "productStatus": "ACTIVE",
  "skuCode": "order-A-001",
  "price": 3000,
  "stock": 5
}

> {%
  client.global.set("productIdA", response.body.productId.toFixed(0));
  client.global.set("skuA", "order-A-001");
%}

### 2) 주문용 상품 B 생성
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "orderProduct-B",
  "description": "for order test B",
  "categoryId": 10,
  "productStatus": "ACTIVE",
  "skuCode": "order-B-001",
  "price": 10000,
  "stock": 2
}

> {%
  client.global.set("productIdB", response.body.productId.toFixed(0));
  client.global.set("skuB", "order-B-001");
%}

### 3) 주문 생성 (A*2 + B*1 = 3000*2 + 10000*1 = 16000원 예상)
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": {{productIdA}}, "skuCode": "{{skuA}}", "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": {{productIdB}}, "skuCode": "{{skuB}}", "quantity": 1 }
  ],
  "address": {
    "receiverName": "홍길동",
    "phone": "010-1234-5678",
    "zipcode": "06236",
    "address1": "서울 강남구 테헤란로 00",
    "address2": "101동 202호"
  }
}

> {%
  client.global.set("orderId", response.body.orderId.toFixed(0));
%}

### 4) 주문 상세로 totalAmount 확보
GET {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}

> {%
  client.global.set("orderAmount", response.body.totalAmount);
%}

### 5) (스텁) 결제 승인 - 성공(DONE) → 주문 상태 PAID로 바뀌어야 함
POST {{base}}/payments/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentKey": "pk_test_stub_001",
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "amount": {{orderAmount}}
}

> {%
  client.global.set("paymentKey", response.body.paymentKey.toFixed(0));
%}

### 6) 주문 상태 확인 (PAID)
GET {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}

### 7) (선택) 결제 취소 - 스텁(CANCELED) 응답, 결제 테이블 상태만 CANCELED로
POST {{base}}/payments/tviva2025091920554293A60/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cancelReason": "단순테스트",
  "cancelAmount": null
}

### 8) 금액 불일치 에러 확인 (400: PAYMENT_AMOUNT_MISMATCH)
POST {{base}}/payments/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentKey": "pk_test_stub_002",
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "amount": {{orderAmount}}
}
